{"parse": {"title": "世界上最小的涟漪-07", "pageid": 147257, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA-06\" title=\"世界上最小的涟漪-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">世界上最小的涟漪-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA-08\" title=\"世界上最小的涟漪-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">世界上最小的涟漪</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.88.90.E4.B8.BA.E8.87.AA.E5.B7.B1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"成为自己\">成为自己</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 成为自己</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Be Thyself</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>隐秘的地下居所第一次迎来这么多的客人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>很抱歉……把你们都牵扯进来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>经过一场逃亡，鱼头人仍旧保持着温和与沉稳，她有些不好意思地摸了摸自己的鱼脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>才没有呢！塔拉萨！我们今天大出风头！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙的气息尚未恢复平缓，可她丝毫不见颓势，逃跑时的狼狈也荡然无存。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>这还是我第一次站在这么大的舞台上演讲呢——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>那感觉太棒了！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她双眼放光，仿佛那吵闹与追捕只是无害的戏剧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>哈哈！我以为演出本身已经够精彩了，你们真是让我刮目相看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>应该说……命运时常具备一些戏剧性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>预言者露出了有点无奈的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>可我还是不理解！为什么大家要对塔拉萨这么坏呢？！他们明明不像坏人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我也是受到了大家的指引，才找到了塔拉萨——那些信息和线索，明明都代表着他们对塔拉萨的憧憬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个对泉水宁芙来说过于复杂的问题，令她忧愁地捧住了自己的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>难道是我的话给大家造成了误会，让他们误解了塔拉萨？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>这可不行——我一定要好好和他们解释清楚！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她又跳了起来，立刻就要行动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>不要去，纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>裁判抓住她的手臂，适时阻止了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>谢谢你，纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>你没有令他们产生误解，他们也确实不是坏人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鱼头人圆溜溜的眼里闪烁着光芒，她的声音舒缓，能够抚平情绪的褶皱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>只是……对于很多人来说，面对自己完全未知的东西时，“排斥”是他们的第一反应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>因为他们无从分辨那未知是安全还是危险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>咦？是这样吗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙的眉头轻轻皱着，努力消化鱼头人的一番话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>虽然我也有很多害怕的东西，但对于从来没见过的东西，我总是很好奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闻言，塔拉萨笑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>纳西索斯，我知道，你从来都没有害怕过未知——所以你才是你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>独一无二的你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>那当然啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她快乐地接受了这份珍贵的评价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>不过——我想，这也不是没有来由的，纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>关于泉水宁芙，还有一件事情——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_07\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/Cg-3_9_bg_07.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/Cg-3_9_bg_07.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/Cg-3_9_bg_07.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>塔拉萨，你知道吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一次来到海平面以上的世界，鱼头人满心好奇，恍恍惚惚地接话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在新世界的光与风之中，一切都过于闪亮，甚至刺眼，这种感受称不上舒适。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她觉得——非常畅快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>泉水宁芙生来脆弱，我们的鱼鳍无法承受太大的冲击，尤其在海浪之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>因此，泉水宁芙始终被认为只适合生活在平静的水域之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>原本我也是这么想的——直到我在家乡的石板上读到关于一场远古迁徙的记载。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>当灾难降临于宁静的山林与湖泊时，泉水宁芙不得不离开自己的栖息地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>这个时候，总要有第一个跃入大海的宁芙，带领大家逃离这场灾难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>她是战胜了恐惧，还是早就心有所往？石板上的记载未能阐明这种细微的心情……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>不过这启发了我——或许泉水宁芙并不是一个脆弱的种族，我们只是需要一颗种子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>一颗种子……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>在所有的时间里，你们从不缺乏跃入大海的勇气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315722.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-315722.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315722.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315722.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-315722.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315722.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-315722.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315722.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>这条项链，它应该属于你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315723.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315723.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我、我吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她惊讶得说不出话来，掌蹼颤抖着碰了碰项链，它闪烁着奇异的辉光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>我相信多里斯一定和你说了一些话，那些话使你来到这里与我见面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>是的……塔拉萨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>我也相信多里斯一定没有给你太多的线索，所以在此之前，你吃尽了苦头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她轻轻抬起手，帮呆立着的宁芙戴上了项链。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>请原谅她吧，多里斯一向如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-315701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>不……我从来没有怪过多里斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的掌蹼真真正正地握住了胸前的项链，那触感冰凉而坚硬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我只是……我只是想念她，但是我再也不能和她说话了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我想要多里斯亲眼看到我的变化，我的胜利……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>可是这些都再也实现不了了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这一次，她强忍着没有再让眼泪流出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>但是，塔拉萨，你和多里斯都说过，我只要成为我自己——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>虽然我现在还不知道，到底怎么成为自己，怎么才算成为自己！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>但我一定能找到答案，多里斯也一定不希望我放弃！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>嘿，纳西索斯，还有我们呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火山岛的朋友们立刻发出声援。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>对，还有你们和塔拉萨！对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>当然，纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>相信你可以发挥好项链的最后一次效用，实现自己的梦想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>梦想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她捧起那枚洁白的鳞片，双眼闪闪发光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>——制胜的秘宝！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_yuanye1\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_yuanye1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>太好了！阿波罗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>你给我的神谕果然没有错！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>虽然一开始没什么线索，但最后还是让我找到了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我们快启程回火山岛吧！我已经等不及要去打败赫多涅了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>焕然一新的宁芙戴着闪亮的项链，她抓起头盔，整装待发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>我以为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>我以为经此一役，纳西索斯她一定已经领会了一些深刻的道理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>至少不会再那么执着地追求一场胜利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>信使压低了帽檐，悄悄关注着不远处兴高采烈的宁芙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>真是少见，我们最务实的荷米斯殿下也在意起“深刻的道理”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>预言者推了推眼镜，一本正经地开起玩笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>因为打败赫多涅实在是太难了嘛……而且，她现在更相信那个“神谕”了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>我并不觉得纳西索斯会停下她的脚步，或者放弃那些看起来不可能的挑战。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>——因为她生来如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>但这件事我们需要各自负起责任，尤其是你，阿波罗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>我很期待你要如何为你的神谕“收场”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在裁判冰冷的注视之下，预言者不得不移开了视线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315723.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315723.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>你们还不准备出发吗——时间要来不及了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不远处，对新的旅程迫不及待的宁芙朝他们大力挥手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>预言者耸了耸肩，借此替自己解围。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>我只能说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>纳西索斯的故事还远远没有到尾声。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "世界上最小的涟漪-07"}}